OL,3,GNEWSACouple ask Yorkshire Water for
OL,4,A#39,000 after cellar flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple have taken legal action
OL,7,Fagainst Yorkshire Water after a leaking
OL,8,Fsewage pipe flooded their cellar -
OL,9,Fresulting in what they claim is
OL,10,Fpermanent damage.
OL,12,FSteven and Tracy Ashmore have asked for
OL,13,Fcompensation of #39,000 over the
OL,14,Fincident at their terraced home in
OL,15,FChapeltown, Sheffield.
OL,17,FYorkshire Water did repair the broken
OL,18,Fpipe, but the Ashmores said delays in
OL,19,Fthe action taken by its engineers left
OL,20,Fthe cellar in poor condition.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
