OL,3,GNEWSACouple ask Yorkshire Water for
OL,4,A#39,000 after cellar flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Water said its staff returned
OL,7,Fto the property on "several occasions"
OL,8,Fbut apologised for the couple's
OL,9,F"distressing experience".
